SmartSessionERC7739::contextReplay
└── given an envelope signed by the session key for one account, chain and app domain
    ├── when it is replayed on another chain id
    │   └── it never reverts and returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
    ├── when it is replayed on another account with the same session
    │   └── it returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
    ├── when it is replayed on another emissary without the session
    │   └── it returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
    ├── when it is replayed on another emissary with the same session
    │   └── it returns ERC1271_MAGIC_VALUE
    └── when it is replayed under another enabled app domain
        └── it returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
